Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: opaque readable DeskClock widget

Squashed from:
- 0001-opaque-readable-clock-widget
- 0002-match-night-widget-preview
- 0006-preserve-widget-default-choice

Change-Id: I716c5c583b1b37084a68ed188e93b858e2f6a82f

Analog widget: the white dial and hands are tinted ink, and the picker previews the live layout instead of the white preview image.
